THIRD PARTY NOTICES
===================

This file covers every third-party work that this project (`sts2_lobby_enhance`) interacts with.


1. STS2 LAN Connect (the mod this patch repairs)
-----------------------------------------------
Project : STS2 LAN Connect / 游戏大厅, mod id `sts2_lan_connect`, version 0.6.3
Author  : "mac"
Licence : GNU General Public License v3.0
Source  : https://github.com/emptylower/STS2-Game-Lobby
Workshop: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3749766330

No file, binary or archive from that project is redistributed here. This mod is published as a
separate Workshop item that *declares* the item above as a required dependency, and it locates the
upstream assembly at runtime through `AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies()`.

The source code, however, does contain logic ported from that project, and this is deliberate:

  * `Scripts/Tail/TailErrorPathFix.cs` reimplements `LanConnectTailMessageRuntime.AbortActiveBinding`
    and `RejectAndDisconnect` as line-for-line ports, changing only the game API calls whose
    signatures 0.113 altered.
  * `Scripts/Gameplay/AbandonRunFix.cs` replays the upstream "abandon current run" flow step by step,
    calling the upstream mod's own helpers through reflection.
  * `Scripts/Join/JoinTakeoverFix.cs` reuses the upstream mod's net-service factory and tail_v1
    binding, again by reflection.

Because those parts are derivative works of GPL-3.0 code, this project as a whole is distributed
under GPL-3.0. The complete licence text is in `LICENSE`; it is byte-identical to the upstream copy.
If you redistribute this mod, or a modified version of it, the GPL-3.0 obligations apply.


